{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t警務處明日為高級警員朱振國舉行警隊最高榮譽喪禮，遺體將會安葬浩園。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n喪禮明早10時半在紅磡世界殯儀館舉行，其後在長沙灣分區警署進行道別儀式，安葬儀式下午約12時半在浩園舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:02:37.086633+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:42:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T07:18:01.920761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:58:18.216043+00:00","content_hash":"68730c9e34571f4e9d6d449c52a030b28e5232e9b29702c0c3d41b1aff758e94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}